{"url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/", "text": "Department of Chemistry, Namrup College, Namrup, Assam - 786623\nApply Online\nNamrup, Assam - 786623\nprincipalnamrupcollege@gmail.com\nHome\nAbout Us\nAdministration\nGoverning Body\nPrincipal\nVice Principal\nAcademic In-charge\nOffice Staff\nProcedures and Policies\nSecretary and DDO\nCode of conduct\nEx-Principal and Faculty\nIDP\nAcademics\nCourses Offered\nAdmission Procedure\nFee Structure\nSyllabus\nAcademic Calendar\nCourse Outcome\nFaculty member\nCBCS\nResearch & Development Cell\nStrategic Plan\nTeaching Learning and Evaluation\nCurricular Aspects\nResearch Innovations and Extension\nInfrastructures and Learning Resources\nStudent Support and Progression\nGovernance Leadership and Management\nInstitutional Values and Best Practices\nDepartments\nAssamese\nBotany\nChemistry\nComputer Science\nEconomics\nEducation\nEnglish\nHistory\nMathematics\nPhysics\nPolitical Science\nSociology\nZoology\nStudent Cells\nStudent Union\nCollege Magazine\nNSS Unit\nAnnual Sports\nCode of conduct\nAssessment and transparency\nGrievance Redressal Cell\nStudent Awards\nStandard Club\nFacilities\nLibrary\nHostel\nCanteen\nSkill Development\nComputer\nMedical\nSports\nInfrastructure\nICT facilities and application\nYoga and Meditation\nBotanical Garden\nInstitutional Biotech Hub\nStudy Centre\nDUODL\nKKHSOU\nAmbedkar Study Centre\nGandhian Study Centre\nIQAC\nAbout IQAC\nIQAC Committee\nActivity\nMeeting Minutes\nReports\nBest Practices\nAQAR\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nSSS Report\nIQAC Reports\nFeedback Report\nCollege Annual Report\nIIQA\nPhoto Gallery\nContact Us\nDepartment of Chemistry\nNEP 2020 Syllabus\nStudents projcet report\nDepartment of Chemistry, Namrup College, Namrup  was established by a dint of painstaking effort of some local worthies and under the dynamic leadership of Mrs. Bulbul Borgohain, ex-faculty and HOD, Namrup College, Namrup in the year of 1973.The Major Course was introduced in\n2003\n. Presently, the Department has three permanent teachers with good track records. Faculty members impart teaching in an interactive and student-friendly environment by using the Audio- Visual system.\nThe Department offers Undergraduate programs in Degree level in B.Sc. Major with Chemistry (Six Semester course) with an intake capacity of 20 students and B. Sc. program with Chemistry (Six Semester Course).\nThe students mostly come from economically backward classes. The teachers are quite helpful and due to their dedication and involvement, most of the students do well and some of Chemistry graduates clear various entrance examinations and are able to get admission for pursuing post-graduate courses in Central and State Universities and NITS. Apart from classroom teaching, faculty members are involved in research projects and other social outreach programs organized by the college family. Major students are encouraged to take up small literature surveys and experimental based projects under the supervision of the faculty. The Department also provides Industrial In-plant training program for necessary scientific exposure to students in collaboration with BVFCL, and APL, Namrup.\nThe Department publishes a wall magazine which is useful in many ways. Besides scientific and literary articles, it contains information from every sphere. Apart from that Students are actively involved in various social services and other programs which help them to develop their soft skills.\nThe department currently has two well-equipped laboratories that house modern instruments procured from UGC(RUSA) Grant such as Digital Potentiometers, pH meters, colorimeters, Digital conductivity meter, Digital Balance, Polarimeter, Oil-free vacuum pump, Hot air Oven, Magnetic stirrer, Heating Mantle, Instrument for microwave-assisted Reactions, Solvent distillation plant, Apparatus for TLC and Column Chromatography, Water distillation plant, etc.\nName\nDesignation\nQualification\nDate of Joining\nProfile\nDr Utpal Tamuly\nAssociate Professor (HOD)\nM. Sc, Ph. D\n1992-07-14\nView Profile\nMs Mouchumi Konwar\nAssociate Professor\nM.Sc., M.Phil\n2002-09-23\nView Profile\nUsefull Links\nUGC, New Delhi\nNAAC\nIGNOU\nVidya Lakshmi\nUsefull Links\nDibrugarh University\nGauhati University\nTezpur University\nRajib Gandhi University\nUsefull Links\nAHSEC\nDHE, Assam\nACT Association\nGovt. of Assam\nGallery\nContact\nNamrup College, Parbatpur, Namrup, Dibrugarh, Assam - 786623\n03742503226\nprincipalnamrupcollege@gmail.com\nWebsite Convener: Jayanta Sonowal\nCopyright ©\nAll rights reserved. Powered by\nDee Tech Solution", "links": [{"label": "Apply Online", "url": "http://onlineportal.namrupcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "principalnamrupcollege@gmail.com", "url": "mailto:principalnamrupcollege@gmail.com"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "About Us", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/about-namrup-college/"}, {"label": "Administration", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/department/chemistry/"}, {"label": "Governing Body", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/governing-body/"}, {"label": "Principal", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/principals-messages/"}, {"label": "Vice Principal", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/vice-principal/"}, {"label": "Academic In-charge", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/academic-in-charge/"}, {"label": "Office Staff", "url": "https://namrupcollege.edu.in/data/page/office-staff/"}, {"label": "Procedures and Polici